{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"The `read_command` function retrieves the full implementation details and metadata for a specific command within a given library and control context. It accepts the library name, control identifier, and command name as inputs, then traverses the datastore to locate and assemble the command's source code, description, and configuration. The function returns a JSON object containing the command's code body, language type, and descriptive metadata, or an error status if any component of the command hierarchy is missing.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\n","params":[{"name":"lib","type":"String"},{"name":"ctl","type":"String"},{"name":"cmd","type":"String"}],"returntype":"JSONObject","type":"rust"},"id":"krpzxz19ed5b4aed9v2cad","readers":[],"time":1784387808514,"username":"system","writers":[]}